    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ SETUP — Replace these placeholders before activating\n\n**Google Drive Folder IDs** (get from Drive URL):\n- `WINNERS_FOLDER_ID` — folder you drop winning ads into\n- `PROCESSED_FOLDER_ID` — where processed ads are archived\n- `DIRECT_MEDS_OUTPUT_FOLDER_ID` — DM creative outputs\n- `DIRECT_MEDS_BRAND_KIT_FOLDER_ID` — DM logos/product images\n- `MEDVI_OUTPUT_FOLDER_ID` — Medvi creative outputs\n- `MEDVI_BRAND_KIT_FOLDER_ID` — Medvi logos/product images\n- `TRIMRX_OUTPUT_FOLDER_ID` — TrimRx creative outputs\n- `TRIMRX_BRAND_KIT_FOLDER_ID` — TrimRx logos/product images\n\n**API Keys:**\n- `YOUR_OPENROUTER_API_KEY` — openrouter.ai → Keys\n- Update `HTTP-Referer` header to your domain or app name\n- `YOUR_HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY` — Higgsfield dashboard\n- `YOUR_EMAIL_HERE` — your notification email\n\n**Brand Kit folders** should contain files with 'logo' or 'product' in their filename.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "1bd2a952-1ddd-4571-b23b-b69a581e64bf",
